OL,3,GNEWSAKey dates and times for Yorkshire
OL,4,AChristmas markets
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristmas markets in York, Leeds and
OL,7,FSheffield will soon be open, welcoming
OL,8,Fvisitors and locals as the festive
OL,9,Fseason gets underway.
OL,11,FThe markets, typically selling food,
OL,12,Fdrink and handmade gifts, will open in
OL,13,FYorkshire cities and several towns in
OL,14,Fthe coming weeks.
OL,16,FAs well as the three biggest markets,
OL,17,Fmany others are also held around the
OL,18,Fregion, from Scarborough to Skipton,
OL,19,FHarrogate to Halifax and Barnsley to
OL,20,FBradford.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
